                <h2>2. Use of Information</h2>
                <p>Your data is processed strictly for enterprise fulfillment, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Authenticating identity and provisioning session persistence.</li>
                    <li>Generating real-time dispatch manifests for biometric hardware (SecuGen, Mantra, printers).</li>
                    <li>Dispatching transactional OTP verifications and critical security alerts via automated email
                        relays.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Media Storage & Cleanup</h2>
                <p>Profile avatars uploaded to the platform are stored on Cloudinary. When a user updates their profile
                    image, preceding image assets are automatically purged using our automated destruction pipelines to
                    prevent residual media retention.</p>

                <h2>4. Third-Party Integrations</h2>
                <p>We work exclusively with audited enterprise infrastructure:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Google Identity Services:</strong> Facilitating verified OAuth single sign-on (SSO).
                    </li>
                    <li><strong>Supabase / PostgreSQL:</strong> Secure storage of user records and server-side shopping
                        sessions.</li>
                    <li><strong>UPI Merchant Gateways:</strong> Direct beneficiary routing via NPCI-compliant UPI rails.
                    </li>
                </ul>

